'''Gloomy Neneko''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be unlocked via the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Halloween Capsules (Gacha Event)|Halloween Capsules]] and [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]] grants the ability [[Wave Shield]].

